  at /tmp/cancro-last_kmsg.txt.prev (then .prev.2, ...) whenever there is one to park, and that path is where an
  earlier bracket lives. Read it for the earlier death and never as this run's, whatever the
  bracket in it says - and read 'gone with nothing parked' as the capture it is, not as the park
  it is not: with nothing at this name at gate time (the absent case below) step 2b has nothing to
  move, so an absence after the run is this run's capture having failed, not an earlier log tucked
